  "description": "System-composition (.NET 5+) flavor of Combobulate: the 3D renderer bound to the system Windows.UI.Composition surface with NO Windows App SDK dependency, for XAML-free hosts (e.g. a DesktopWindowTarget on WS_EX_NOREDIRECTION_BITMAP). Exposes the same Combobulate API as the WinAppSdk build under a distinct assembly name (Combobulate.SystemComp) so both can be referenced side by side. Enables the BakedAspectGraph rendering mode in the XAML-free build.",
